[?2004l[?2004h> | 2 | Patch CVE-2017-0144 (MS17-010 / EternalBlue) | SMBv1 / `srv.sys` | PROPOSED | **CORRECTED**: Replaced wrong CVE-2019-0708 (BlueKeep) with true exploit vector MS17-010 (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`). |
[?2004l[?2004h> | 3 | Audit/Remove cron miner | `/var/spool/cron/root` | INVALID | **DOWNGRADED**: Host `smb-prod-01` is Windows (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`); Linux cron path is invalid. Real miner persistence is WMI/DLL based (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`, `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`). |
