[?2004l[?2004h> | 10 | Configure SIEM log forwarding & log clear alert | `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx` | PROPOSED | **ADDED**: Remediate event log tampering (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`). Enable alert on Event ID 1102. |
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## 2. Prioritised Execution Phases
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 1: Immediate Network Containment & Host Isolation
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Network Blocks**: Block inbound traffic from IP `198.51.100.218` and sinkhole domain `update-smb.example.cn` at perimeter firewalls (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Credential Resets**: Perform domain-wide password resets for accounts logged in during the compromise window due to LSASS dump (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 2: Evidence Preservation, Quarantine & Artifact Eradication
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Quarantine Malware Artifacts**: Move `/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`, `/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`, `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`, and `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll` into an encrypted quarantine archive rather than direct deletion (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`, `/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`, `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`, `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Purge Persistence**: Remove the malicious WMI `__EventFilter` and `CommandLineEventConsumer` entries from the WMI repository (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`). Replace `wbemcomn.dll` with a verified clean system version (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Vulnerability Patching & System Hardening
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Patch & Disable SMBv1**: Apply security update MS17-010 (CVE-2017-0144) and disable SMBv1 feature (`Disable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName SMB1Protocol`) (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Enable LSA Protection**: Configure `RunAsPPL=1` in `HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Lsa` to prevent unauthorized LSASS memory reading (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ### Phase 4: Verification & Operational Validation
[?2004l[?2004h> 1. **Verify WMI Repository Integrity**: Query `Get-CimInstance -Namespace root\subscription -ClassName __EventFilter` to verify no unauthorized filters remain (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 2. **Verify SMB Configuration**: Run `Get-SmbServerConfiguration` to confirm `EnableSMB1Protocol : False` (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Verify Central Logging**: Confirm System event log (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`) forwards to central SIEM and triggers alert on Event ID 1102.
